<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>enthusiasm</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'enthousiasme<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 enthusiasm</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/in'θju:ziæzәm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɑ̃tuzjasm/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('enthusiasm', 'l\'enthousiasme')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 巨大的热情, 热心</td><td class='def-en'>a feeling of excitement</td><td>4.02</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of enthusiasm (a feeling of excitement).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> feeling</div></div></td></tr>
