<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>pity</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le ruth<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 pity</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'piti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁy/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('pity', 'le ruth')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 遗憾, 同情, 怜悯, 憾事, 可惜</td><td class='def-en'>a feeling of sympathy and sorrow for the misfortunes of others</td><td>3.98</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“the blind are too often objects of pity”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>commiseration</span><span class='syn-tag'>ruth</span><span class='syn-tag'>pathos</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> sympathy</div></div></td></tr>
